# Output directory for generated plots and logs.
#
# This folder is kept in the repository (via this file) so it survives the push.
# Its contents are produced at runtime and are intentionally NOT committed:
#
#   mappo_training.png                     mappo/mappo_optimized_4.py
#   mappo_comparison.png                   mappo/mappo_optimized_4.py
#   fixedtime_simulation_results.png       baselines/fixed_time/fixed_time_for_mappo_4.py
#   fixedtime_intersection_comparison.png  baselines/fixed_time/fixed_time_for_mappo_4.py
#   sumo_errors.log                        both
#
# Note: by default the scripts write to their own `saved_models/` directory
# rather than here. Pass --results-save-path results/ to redirect output here.
